commits.body:
P2-04's row is done with its three commits. Four follow-ups: the icon
and the Linux desktop entries stay in frontend.cpp until the icon's
bytes have a C contract header; the window part of open stays with open;
state.h's name and the moved code's member comments and blank lines;
and the layering rules that pin frontend.cpp's exceptions by line, which
P2-04 updated outside its listed paths.
